invalid type: string "4.2 Re-evaluation Fee:\r\nThe re-evaluation fee is Rs. 750 per subject.\r\n\r\n4.3 Application Deadline:\r\nStudents must submit the re-evaluation application and prescribed fee within the deadline announced by the university.\r\n\r\n4.4 Re-evaluation Result:\r\nThe result after re-evaluation shall be processed according to the applicable examination regulations.\r\n\r\nÿÿÿÿÿ